      "message": "@michaelludwig@google.com, _functionally_, your suggestion made things better.\n\nI don\u0027t like how lots of the same information is sent to both UploadSource and UploadInstance in the end. I could cache these parameters in `UploadSource` itself for `UploadInstance` to pick up; that\u0027d be some minor copies with purely aesthetic benefits. If you have no preference here, I think I\u0027ll do that.",
