      "writtenOn": "2025-08-20T13:17:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have some work in progress to change to how the CPU data conversion functions are implemented, where a function will be returned for handling a given TextureFormat + src/dst colorinfo.  At that point, I think that function could be stored on the UploadSource and none of the redundant parameters would need to be placed in UploadInstance.\n\nI\u0027m hoping to come back to that work very soon, so it wouldn\u0027t be in this state for long. I\u0027m inclined to keep it this way and clean it up then, instead of requiring storing the color infos on the UploadSource.  But it also shouldn\u0027t be a performance cost to store the dimensions and two SkColorInfos on the UploadSource.",
      "parentUuid": "104e8d4a_cc81f8d7",
